# Intent: What a locked unit refuses, and a Lock button on the More screen. Locked: the wake word engine, voice processing and the stop word stay off (a wake word that still arrives is dropped; unlocking arms the wake word again for an idle unit); no swipe does anything (the pages gesture hook returns), no page, sheet, settings, Wi-Fi, More or quick settings screen opens (by touch or by the self.page.show tool), no game starts; remote controllers are refused (self.remote.session, say, action and the gate for every cued kind) except find my robot, which still beeps and flashes; a touch, the wake word or a remote action restarts the auto lock timer. The More screen shows a Lock button beside Quick settings while a code is set (owner decision: the control sheet keeps its one row of six tiles and has no lock tile); a tap locks at once.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/xiaozhi-esp32/main/audio/audio_service.cc, application.cc (small hooks), firmware/main/hal/maipai_pages.cc, maipai_pages_unit.cc, maipai_more.cc, maipai_games.cc, maipai_remote.cc, maipai_screen.cc (ours)
# Check after a flash: Locked: say the wake word (nothing wakes), swipe up from the bottom (no sheet), call self.page.show and self.game.start (both refused), call self.remote.action with kind move (refused) and with kind find (beeps and flashes). Unlocked with a code set: Quick settings, More shows a Lock button and a tap locks. The control sheet is unchanged.
# Kconfig: CONFIG_MAIPAI_LOCK

